  "description": "VOODOO MARASA WOMEN\n\nThe Marasa Women Hybrid bike takes inspiration from Voodoo’s range of mountain bikes to provide a bike that’s fast, comfortable, and perfectly optimized for urban riding. The frame geometry, sizing and components of the Marasa Women are perfectly balanced to fit shorter riders.\n\nWith a reliable Shimano drivetrain, powerful hydraulic disc brakes and tough Maxxis Overdrive tires, you’ll be able to easily explore all over your local area and discover the joys of cycling. For those who need the bike as a day-to-day option, bottle, rack and mudguard mounts ensure the Marasa Women Hybrid bike is a practical option. With such a carefully considered design, the Marasa is an extremely versatile and capable hybrid bike.\n\nThe Marasa Women Hybrid bike takes inspiration from Voodoo’s range of mountain bikes to provide a bike that’s fast, comfortable, and perfectly optimized for urban riding.",
